 "address": "Vlaardingenlaan 158-440 / Overschiestraat / Rodenrijsstraat, Nieuw-Sloten: 2022 L-shaped housing pand of three parts, a nine-storey east wing in orange-brown brick with a grid frame of piers and floor bands round dark glazed infill (a two-storey plinth frame, a two-storey crown frame) and a plain brick end bay, a five-storey cream brick middle block on Vlaardingenlaan, a ten-storey pale ochre tower with loggias in every frame cell at the west end, and a white-brick slab-balcony block over a pilotis passage at the north end of Overschiestraat (kit batch 2005+, lane kit-batch-2005-20261121)",
